     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve ran <i><b>sequenza</b></i> on multiple samples from the same tumor and realised that the &quot;segments&quot; printed in *segments.txt are not exactly the same between samples.</div><div>For instance:</div><div><br></div><div>SampleA:</div><div><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.72);color:rgb(244,244,244);font-family:Monaco;font-size:10px\">chr1</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.72);color:rgb(244,244,244);font-family:Monaco;font-size:10px\">\t</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.72);color:rgb(244,244,244);font-family:Monaco;font-size:10px\">861360</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.72);color:rgb(244,244,244);font-family:Monaco;font-size:10px\">\t</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.72);color:rgb(244,244,244);font-family:Monaco;font-size:10px\">120529750</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.72);color:rgb(244,244,244);font-family:Monaco;font-size:10px\">\t</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.72);color:rgb(244,244,244);font-family:Monaco;font-size:10px\">0.498945460101109</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.72);color:rgb(244,244,244);font-family:Monaco;font-size:10px\">\t</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.72);color:rgb(244,244,244);font-family:Monaco;font-size:10px\">1526</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.72);color:rgb(244,244,244);font-family:Monaco;font-size:10px\">\t</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;background-color: